# The per-endpoint CloudSignal "Webhook API key" from your Cloudprinter.com
# Dashboard. CloudSignal sends it as a plaintext `apikey` field IN the JSON body
# of every webhook (there is NO signature header/HMAC). This key is DIFFERENT
# from your account API key. The handler compares the body's apikey against this
# value with a timing-safe comparison.
CLOUDSIGNAL_WEBHOOK_APIKEY=your_webhook_api_key
